{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_3_level_main_03-01_beg","groupId":"main_3","stageId":"main_03-01","title":"会合","storyCode":"3-1","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_03-01_beg.txt","sourceHash":"892310c68041f5b3fae3a7143fd2a56b8ba7ef693708aacabb3a911fca5ccd91","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"汇合后，罗德岛得知米莎被W劫走。在阿米娅的追问下，陈终于说出了米莎的秘密。\n这一次，近卫局决定与罗德岛联手。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第二十三关（前）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wild_m"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"看来你们也不怎么好过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"陈长官，究竟发生了什么事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"整合运动的埋伏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"没有增援，火力猛烈，近卫局的队形很快被他们冲散了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"那米莎......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"被一个红衣服的女人劫走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我真该——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"没什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"陈长官，米莎身上究竟有什么?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"再继续隐瞒下去，罗德岛与近卫局的合作进程只会越来越艰难。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我没有告知你的义务。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"但罗德岛有了解目标并做出应对策略的义务。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛在行动中会听从近卫局的指挥——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，即便是用感染者去对抗感染者，我们也是需要情报的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"近卫局拥有信息，却不懂得如何对抗感染者才能减少损失。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛有对抗感染者的能力，却不知道整合运动想要什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你刚才说的话，有点那个医生的味道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"是，是嘛......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我想......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"这是因为，这对于我们双方来说都很重要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"如果要请示魏先生的话——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我们调查了米莎相关的情报，有一条情报指出，她的父亲是切尔诺伯格的要人之一。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"米莎的父亲？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，我们也不知道，米莎究竟握有多少切尔诺伯格的资料。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"可能是零，也可能是一百。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"谁都不会知道有多少——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"——除了米莎本人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"而那些切尔诺伯格的信息，究竟含括哪些内容，我们也不清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"既然你们推测整合运动的下一个目标是龙门——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，阻止整合运动对切尔诺伯格的利用是理所应当的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，我们并不想让整合运动得到这名感染者，米莎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"包括“有这样一个感染者随着逃难的人群进入了龙门”这条情报在内——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"在你发现米莎之前，我也并不能确定这几条情报的真实性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"这样的话，就不能再拖了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"必须在整合运动回到切尔诺伯格前阻止他们，救回米莎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛，立刻进行整备！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"追缉这名感染者，是我们近卫局的任务。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"——同时，让她落入整合运动之手，也是我们的失职。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"比起共同追缉，我们需要罗德岛清除整合运动的其他威胁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"这是命令。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"——我明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"交给你了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不要！别，别打我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"进入龙门之前难道没想过自己的下场吗！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"啊呀呀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"全都关起来！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"不是这批感染者。该死......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"不是这批。该死......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局队员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"他们......撤退的太快了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"看来整合运动也是分层次的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"留下来殿后的这些，都是些用来拖延时间的渣滓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"一个人拖住整个增援部队......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"难道会是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局队员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"长官！那边还有残存的整合运动成员！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"跟我来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局队员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局队员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"陈长官，小心！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局队员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"有埋伏！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":true,"text":"去，去死吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"别惹恼我————！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局队员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"陈长官，我们还在龙门城范围内！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局队员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"周围的设施可能还有它用，请不要过度破坏！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"要你说！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局队员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"至少别再把那些房间切成块了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"可，可恶......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"这个女人，很难办！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"——难办？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"愚蠢的感染者......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"————"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"龙门难道是个允许你们随便撒野的地方吗？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"近卫局，进攻！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["阿米娅"]},{"speakerId":"char_010_chen","aliases":["陈"]},{"speakerId":"char_015_lmg","aliases":["近卫局队员"]},{"speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","aliases":["整合运动成员"]}]}
